      "title": "陳書卷十七·王沖",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p005",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "。文帝嗣位，解少傅，加特進、左光祿大夫。尋又以本官領丹陽尹，參撰律令。廢帝即位，給親信十人。",
